Typically, a firm greatly benefits from having a clearly defined target market.
Because of the specificity of its targeted customer, Abercrombie & Fitch can
keep abreast of the clothing trends for its market, it can focus its marketing and
promotional campaigns, and it can develop deep core competencies pertaining
to its specific marketplace. A company such as Gap has a larger challenge
because its stores appeal to a broader range of clientele. In fact, when a retailer
